# Thmanyah: its licence allows the files only inside a built product, so they come from the private
# tshi-dev/urtv-fonts repo at build time (CI), never from here; urtv.html inlines them, so it is not committed either
assets/fonts/Thmanyah*.woff2
android/launcher/src/main/assets/fonts/Thmanyah*.otf
dist/urtv.html
.fonts-private/

